# Build-environment noise on Windows dev boxes, never source.
*.stackdump

# coord-mcp device credential (nonce/JWT) written into the worktree as
# .mcp.json at launch — a live credential, never commit it.
# (Was only in .git/info/exclude — local-only, lost on fresh clone/CI.)
.mcp.json

# Vision capture scratch cache. The runner writes UI Bridge captures here at
# RUNTIME, into its own repo root:
#   src-tauri/src/mcp/ui_bridge/vision_routes.rs -> current_runner_path().join("tmp_vision_cache")
# Leaving it untracked-but-not-ignored makes any checkout that has served a
# capture permanently dirty, which silently disables dev-start's
# Resolve-PrimaryTreeStaleness auto-fast-forward (it self-heals only a CLEAN
# tree) — that is how a shared checkout drifts tens of commits behind main.
tmp_vision_cache/

# Perf-harness run artifacts (scripts/perf-harness.mjs). Run JSONs and rendered
# markdown tables are measurements of a specific machine at a specific moment —
# they belong in the plan doc or a PR comment, never in the tree.
.perf-harness/
